From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:29:51 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: nine display cases in the lower wings hold the
 trophies

Sprite 314 (16 x 32, drawn by scripts/gen-trophy-sprites.py) is a glass display case.
Nine cases stand in the lower wings, four left and five right, always present; each cup's
trophy actor moved inside its case. The wary visitor moved out of the corner. Cases share
one sprite load (the champion's first line drew as noise without it); the trophy is z 288
with height 7 so it sorts in front of the case at z 280.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
